win7-taskbar.png: IMAGE 845, TaskBar2Composited::TaskBar BACKGROUNDBOTTOM, 1 x 3, top sizing margin 2.
win7-task-1..6.png: IMAGE 1014, TaskBand2 TASKITEM, native 60 x 40 frames 1..6 of the 60 x 400 sheet. Sizing margins left/right/top/bottom 3/3/3/3; content margins 10/10/4/4.
win7-desktop-normal/hover/pressed.png: IMAGE 1107, ShowDesktop::Button, native 17 x 40 frames. Sizing margins 2/2/15/2.
win7-clock-normal/hover/pressed.png: IMAGE 1060, TrayNotify::Clock, native 55 x 29 frames. Sizing margins 2/2/14/14; content margins 5/4/0/0.

The original IMAGE PNG resources use premultiplied RGB despite the PNG format. Exported PNGs convert RGB to straight alpha and preserve alpha. Frames are cropped without resampling.
Alpha convention reference: https://github.com/nptr/msstyleEditor/blob/master/libmsstyle/ImageConverter.cs

